   "text": "Oh, poor her. Something smooth and gentle then. Would she prefer a sweet carrot and ginger, or something more savory like a leek and potato?",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 0.41,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cooking.ctx8"
  },
  {
